# N4 (LMX_semantics.ru.md #fields: a root for: of the data is one head for): the cursor i is declared in the head of
# the root for of D, not by a root head of D, so D has no place i. The admission fails when the program runs: the
# implicit call throw, taken by catch: call; D\total keeps 0. Entry 7.
S:
    int: i 7
end: S
D:
    int: total 0
    for: int(i, 0) (i < 3) i++
        total: total + i
    end: for
end: D
fn: run () int
    int: r 82
    call: S D
    catch: call ()
        r: 83
        if: D\total = 0
            r: 7
    ---
return: r
int: got run()
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: got; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
